# Harness (paste into your project's CLAUDE.md if you want the protocol stated per project)

This project uses the AutoSolutions harness plugin. Delegate by role: `harness:scout` for codebase search, `harness:builder` for scoped implementation, `harness:refuter` before claiming a change is done, `harness:judge` once before merge. For multi-file work run `/harness:ship`, before a PR run `/harness:review`, for codebase-wide concerns run `/harness:audit`. Never report a change as done without naming the check you ran and its result.
